{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule"]]},"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/init()","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/init(_:)-17f2v","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/init(_:)-2o9bq","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/init(adjacency:)","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/init(edges:)","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/init(vertices:)","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/init(vertices:edges:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/insert(_:)","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/insert(edge:)","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/remove(_:)","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/remove(edge:)","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/removeAll(keepingCapacity:)","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/removeAllEdges(keepingCapacity:)","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/reserveCapacity(vertexCount:edgeCount:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/CustomDebugStringConvertible-Implementations","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/CustomReflectable-Implementations","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/Decodable-Implementations","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/Encodable-Implementations","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/Equatable-Implementations","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/ExpressibleByDictionaryLiteral-Implementations","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/Graph-Implementations","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList\/Hashable-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","generated":true}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An undirected graph stored as adjacency lists: the undirected counterpart of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdjacencyList"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(Boost’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"adjacency_list<…, undirectedS>"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UndirectedAdjacencyList","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The vertex set is any set of "},{"code":"Hashable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" values. The edge set is a set of unordered pairs of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertices: self-loops are allowed, parallel edges are not, and "},{"code":"{u, v}","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is the same edge as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"{v, u}","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Vertices are kept in dense slots, with a dictionary from vertex to slot. Edges are kept in an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"array, so an edge’s position in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"edges"},{"type":"text","text":" is an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":" in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0..<edgeCount"},{"type":"text","text":". Each slot has a row of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the slots of its neighbors and a parallel row of the positions of its incident edges; each edge"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is in both its endpoints’ rows, and a self-loop twice in its vertex’s row (as Boost stores it)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The rows share one array per kind, so the graph makes a constant number of allocations however"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"many vertices it has. A dictionary from unordered slot pair to position answers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"contains(edge:)"},{"type":"text","text":" in O(1)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Removing an edge is O(1): the last edge moves into its position, and the last entry of each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"row into the hole. Removing a vertex costs O(degree) and moves the last slot into its place. So","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vertex order, edge order and edge positions are unspecified and may change after a removal.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Each edge keeps the orientation it was first inserted with.","type":"text"}]}]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/documentation\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"title":"UndirectedAdjacencyList","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"UndirectedAdjacencyList","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:19AdjacencyListModule010UndirectedaB0V","symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"UndirectedAdjacencyList"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"UndirectedAdjacencyList.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/AdjacencyListModule\/UndirectedAdjacencyList.swift#L23"},"modules":[{"name":"AdjacencyListModule"}]},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/s28CustomDebugStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/s17CustomReflectableP","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/Se","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/SE","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/SQ","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/s30ExpressibleByDictionaryLiteralP","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/SH","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/AdjacencyListModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/adjacencylistmodule\/undirectedadjacencylist"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://AdjacencyListModule/s17CustomReflectableP":{"tit